            "review_title": "Review at Broma Not-A-Bar",
            "review_text": "Nicola R\nAuckland Central, New Zealand16 contributions\n1\nGood vibes\nMar 2018 • Couples\nWhat a great find on our first trip to Ho Chi Minh! Super friendly and welcoming, great cocktails, nice views across the city streets. 3 visits during our short holiday and the music was excellent each time, some nights DJs, others not, but the tunes suited the place, time of night, and crowd. Tried quite a few cocktails, the Broma martini a favourite as well as Taming the Princess and Black Bruce. The Manager on duty each time was so hospitable and really made us feel at home. Highly recommend this great little bar!\nRead more\nWritten March 27, 2018",
