            "review_text": "Professor_Sparrow 🇮🇪 🇲🇦\nDublin, Ireland15353 contributions\n0\nGreat Chill Place\nMar 2017 • Friends\nThis is one of my favourite (rooftop) bars to chill and relax in while having some drinks. It's very much quieter than some of the other rooftop bars and has a real sense of calm and chill about it. It overlooks 'walking street' and is surrounded by a wonderful collection of high-rise buildings that illuminate at night time to give this a magical feel. Really nice chill out place and worth a visit if you want to sit and enjoy a cocktail or two while overlooking the people and entertainment below.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 25, 2017",
