            "review_text": "TaniaStoy\nAuckland, New Zealand12 contributions\n0\nRooftop Bar Fun\nAug 2016\nThe city is full of rooftops which makes it pretty special and unique to other countries/cities so you have to try them. This rooftop bar had a DJ, a casual vibe and great views of course. However the cocktails weren't the best - tasted like they were pre-mixed and that was backed up by the fact they arrived too quickly which wouldn't happen if they were being made fresh. Regardless this bar is well worth a visit.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 26, 2016",
