            "review_title": "Review at Broma Not-A-Bar",
            "review_text": "murray c\nsydney22 contributions\n0\nA quieter rooftop for a relaxing beverage\nOct 2015 • Business\nIf you are in District one and doing a rooftop bar hop and find the Rex, Caravelle (Saigon Saigon Bar) or even the Sheraton a little to crowded and looking for a nice quiet spot to enjoy a sundowner then head to this bar. Not to hard to find as it is a few doors down from the Duxton, but somehow it is overlooked by many. Service can be a bit slow of you are the only ones there, but once it gets a few tables they open the bar up.\nRead more\nWritten July 1, 2016",
